### Webhooks Consumer — sample requests
#
# Standard Webhooks requires a valid signature. The signatures below are
# PLACEHOLDERS and will be rejected (400). To get a working request, generate
# signed headers with sign.py:
#
#   # v1 (symmetric HMAC) — the /webhooks/crm endpoint:
#   python3 sign.py --secret whsec_MfKQ9r8GKYqrTwjUPD8ILPZIo2LaLaSw \
#     --url http://localhost:9091/webhooks/crm \
#     --type contact.created \
#     --data '{"id":"c-1","fullName":"John Smith","email":"john@example.com"}'
#
#   # v2a (asymmetric Ed25519) — the /webhooks/crm-v2a endpoint. Sign with the
#   # PRIVATE key (whsk_) and the shared endpoint-id (needs `pip install cryptography`):
#   python3 sign.py --secret whsk_4uKPjji/dhB8w6GW3YYDnIMYvXcdHrvH6lidTr4Z+EY= \
#     --endpoint-id ep_2fVZdC8Kx9TR4ZoCqHWt3NnLgRb \
#     --url http://localhost:9091/webhooks/crm-v2a \
#     --type contact.created \
#     --data '{"id":"c-1","fullName":"John Smith","email":"john@example.com"}'
#
# ...then paste the webhook-id / webhook-timestamp / webhook-signature it prints.

@host = http://localhost:9091

### Multi-type endpoint — contact.created (replace signature!)
POST {{host}}/webhooks/crm
content-type: application/json
webhook-id: msg_REPLACE_ME
webhook-timestamp: 0
webhook-signature: v1,REPLACE_ME

{"type":"contact.created","timestamp":"2026-11-13T12:00:00Z","data":{"id":"c-1","fullName":"John Smith","email":"john@example.com"}}

### Multi-type endpoint — contact.updated
POST {{host}}/webhooks/crm
content-type: application/json
webhook-id: msg_REPLACE_ME
webhook-timestamp: 0
webhook-signature: v1,REPLACE_ME

{"type":"contact.updated","timestamp":"2026-11-13T12:00:00Z","data":{"id":"c-1","fullName":"Jane","email":"jane@example.com"}}

### Single-type endpoint — invoice.paid
POST {{host}}/webhooks/billing/invoice-paid
content-type: application/json
webhook-id: msg_REPLACE_ME
webhook-timestamp: 0
webhook-signature: v1,REPLACE_ME

{"type":"invoice.paid","timestamp":"2026-11-13T12:00:00Z","data":{"invoiceId":"i-1","customerId":"c-1","amount":10.5,"currency":"USD"}}

### Asymmetric endpoint (v2a) — contact.created (replace signature with the whsk_ one!)
POST {{host}}/webhooks/crm-v2a
content-type: application/json
webhook-id: msg_REPLACE_ME
webhook-timestamp: 0
webhook-signature: v2a,REPLACE_ME

{"type":"contact.created","timestamp":"2026-11-13T12:00:00Z","data":{"id":"c-1","fullName":"John Smith","email":"john@example.com"}}

### Metrics (Prometheus)
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus

### Metrics (list)
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics
